  "heading": "Log scales: decibels",
  "intro": "$N = 10\\lg\\tfrac{I}{k}$. Dishwasher $62$ dB, pump $50$ dB. How many times as intense is the dishwasher?",
  "level": "AM",
  "topic": "Logarithms",
  "subgroup": {
    "id": 1518,
    "name": "Log scales: decibels, pH, Richter"
  },
  "source": {
    "unit": "1082.25",
    "also": [
      "1082.24"
    ]
  },
  "bible": "data/clip-bibles/logarithms-am.md",
  "env": {
    "Ip": 1,
    "k": 0.37
  },
  "answer": {
    "facts": [
      "Id/Ip = 10**(6/5)"
    ],
    "display": "15.8"
  },
  "lines": [
    {
      "heading": "First, what the question says",
      "tokens": [
        {
          "id": "f",
          "tex": "N=10\\lg\\dfrac{I}{k}"
        }
      ],
      "checks": [
        {
          "form": "N = 10*log(I/k,10)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tokens": [
        {
          "id": "letp",
          "tex": "\\text{Let } I_p=\\text{intensity of pump}"
        },
        {
          "id": "letd",
          "tex": ",\\;\\; I_d=\\text{intensity of dishwasher}"
        }
      ],
      "checks": [
        {
          "form": "Ip = Ip"
        }
      ],
      "heading": "Now solve it"
    },
    {
      "tokens": [
        {
          "id": "pump",
          "tex": "50=10\\lg\\tfrac{I_p}{k}"
        },
        {
          "id": "dish",
          "tex": ",\\quad 62=10\\lg\\tfrac{I_d}{k}"
        }
      ],
      "checks": [
        {
          "form": "50 = 10*log(Ip/k,10)"
        },
        {
          "form": "62 = 10*log(Id/k,10)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tokens": [
        {
          "id": "wtxt",
          "tex": "\\text{We want }\\dfrac{\\text{intensity of dishwasher}}{\\text{intensity of pump}}"
        },
        {
          "id": "wsym",
          "tex": "=\\dfrac{I_d}{I_p}=\\;?"
        }
      ],
      "checks": [
        {
          "form": "R = Id/Ip"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tokens": [
        {
          "tex": "62-50",
          "id": "diff"
        },
        {
          "tex": "=10\\lg\\tfrac{I_d}{k}-10\\lg\\tfrac{I_p}{k}",
          "id": "two"
        }
      ],
      "checks": [
        {
          "start": "62 - 50 = 10*log(Id/k,10) - 10*log(Ip/k,10)",
          "var": "Id"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tokens": [
        {
          "tex": "12",
          "id": "twelve"
        },
        {
          "tex": "=10\\lg\\tfrac{I_d}{I_p}",
          "id": "one",
          "hl": "amber"
        }
      ],
      "checks": [
        {
          "identity": "10*log(a/q,10) - 10*log(b/q,10) = 10*log(a/b,10)"
        },
        {
          "step": "12 = 10*log(Id/Ip,10)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tokens": [
        {
          "tex": "\\lg\\tfrac{I_d}{I_p}=1.2",
          "id": "div"
        }
      ],
      "checks": [
        {
          "step": "log(Id/Ip,10) = 1.2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tokens": [
        {
          "tex": "\\tfrac{I_d}{I_p}=10^{1.2}",
          "id": "unlog"
        },
        {
          "tex": "\\approx 15.8",
          "id": "ans",
          "hl": "emerald"
        }
      ],
      "checks": [
        {
          "step": "Id/Ip = 10**1.2"
        },
        {
          "approx": 15.8,
          "sf": 3
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "outline": [
    "Read the question. Compare two readings: subtract them (write diff, two).",
    "Minus Power: one log of the ratio; the k cancels (write twelve, one).",
    "Divide by 10 (write div).",
    "Un-log: 10 to the power 1.2 (write unlog).",
    "About 15.8 times as intense (write ans, box).",
    "Trap: the answer is not 12 — 12 is the difference in decibels; the question asks how many times."
  ],
  "question": "The noise rating $N$ decibels and the intensity $I$ are connected by $N = 10\\lg\\dfrac{I}{k}$, where $k$ is a constant. A hot water pump is rated $50$ dB and a dishwasher $62$ dB. Find $\\dfrac{\\text{intensity of the dishwasher}}{\\text{intensity of the pump}}$.",
  "scroll": true
}
